WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.648 --> 00:00:20.769
Sign in and open Sales. Every sale your shop has made is listed here, newest first.

2
00:00:20.869 --> 00:00:26.125
Each row shows the sale number, customer, branch, cashier, totals and its status.

3
00:00:26.921 --> 00:00:32.067
The tabs split the list by status. Select Completed to see only finished sales.

4
00:00:33.368 --> 00:00:38.953
Cancelled shows sales that were voided, and Open shows sales still waiting for payment.

5
00:00:39.053 --> 00:00:44.201
Type a sale number, a customer name or a phone number in the search box.

6
00:00:45.324 --> 00:00:51.020
Filters narrow the list by payment status, branch, cashier, payment method or date range.

7
00:00:51.120 --> 00:00:54.730
Choose All payment methods to clear a filter again.

8
00:00:54.830 --> 00:00:57.721
Select View on a row to open the sale.

9
00:00:57.821 --> 00:01:01.812
The sale page shows the items, the totals and who sold it.

10
00:01:01.912 --> 00:01:07.003
Scroll down for the payments that were taken and any refunds against the sale.

11
00:01:07.865 --> 00:01:11.856
Select Receipt to see the printable receipt for this sale.

12
00:01:11.956 --> 00:01:16.551
Select Print for a paper copy whenever a customer asks for one again.

13
00:01:16.651 --> 00:01:20.257
That is how you find any past sale and its receipt.
